# Where the quote form sends a finished request. Leave unset and the form
# falls back to a prefilled email + the phone number (see src/site/quote/submit.js).
# Any form-to-email endpoint that accepts a JSON POST works, e.g.
#   Web3Forms:  https://api.web3forms.com/submit   (add "access_key" server-side or in buildPayload)
#   Formspree:  https://formspree.io/f/<form-id>
# VITE_QUOTE_ENDPOINT=
